00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:37.520
1586 - Yamashiro Province - Yamashina

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:57.600
What a barren stable.

00:01:58.370 --> 00:02:02.350
I am here, right on time, but no one is welcoming me.

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:06.340
I am not trying to blame Master,

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:11.120
but the resident here doesn't even know the basics of courtesy.

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:19.860
What a poor-looking gate.

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:23.580
I can't learn anything from this poverty.

00:02:26.470 --> 00:02:28.790
This grass roof is pretty well made, though.

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:44.800
Good morning. Looks like you've stepped into a giant water hole.

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:46.890
Who the hell are you!?

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:53.240
There, there. Come in and take a bath to cleanse yourself.

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:57.220
I am the resident here. My name is Hechikan.

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:00.270
The Deep Hole of Imperfection

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:07.140
I've heard from Tōhaku.

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:14.640
Lord Furuori wants to make Jurakudai the number one mansion in the world.

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:20.320
That's embarrassing to admit in front of you, Master.

00:03:22.490 --> 00:03:27.060
Once the building actually started, I realize I don't have any good ideas.

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:30.420
Why don't you take a trip out to Yamashina?

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:31.400
Yamashina?

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:34.300
There is a famed person living there.

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:38.490
He is no doubt in my mind the number one aesthete on imperfection.

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:39.460
The best!?

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:47.580
This makes me mad.

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:51.840
That clearly was a trap.

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:54.790
This Hechikan character is testing me.

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:59.620
He is being suspicious of all guests.

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:04.600
How dare you show such disrespect to a lord?

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:07.760
Maybe he has more planned for me.

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:14.500
I'll cut him down!

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:21.680
You must be thirsty.

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:23.610
Drink this.

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:29.190
This is water from that well, I take it?

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:31.830
The well faces the main road.

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:36.310
The horses and people walking all over have dirtied this water. It is undrinkable.

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:44.050
I am a warrior. I request to enter your residence with my swords.

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:48.120
You can tell the quality of the water without drinking it?

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:51.460
What amazing eyes you have.

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:05.620
D-Delicious!

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:09.030
Good, good.

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:13.130
If even the Fujio water from the back mountains can't satisfy you,

00:05:13.180 --> 00:05:15.500
then how can we hold a tea ceremony?

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:22.440
I also have something nice prepared for your aching stomach.

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:36.040
This dark and crumbling house holds neither treasure nor bounties.

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:40.180
He is even using his tea pot to cook porridge.

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:46.170
What a ridiculous tea ceremony...

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:52.740
Delicious yet again!

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:56.890
The water was delicious, too.

00:05:57.350 --> 00:06:00.780
He also brought out the food at just the right time.

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:03.830
Am I being controlled by that man?

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:10.910
Is this all in my mind?

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:13.710
Even this crumbling house is starting to display its elegant simplicity.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:19.640
Is this all a part of how he treats his guests?

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:25.360
Are you finished with the porridge?

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:31.640
The watermelons didn't turn out so well this year.

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:36.130
Please sprinkle some of this on them.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:45.220
Master proclaimed this man as the number one aesthete on imperfection.

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:48.430
I almost believed in his bullshit.

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:52.410
I've heard this before from Master.

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:56.640
Sprinkling sugar on watermelon is blasphemous.

00:06:57.200 --> 00:07:01.270
To not understand the natural taste of things is a sign of immaturity.

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:09.920
I'll have a taste first and then scold him.

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.060
T-This is...

00:07:18.390 --> 00:07:19.150
Salt!

00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:29.120
By adding salt, something this disgusting becomes delicious!

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:34.280
I told you, the watermelons didn't turn out so well this year.

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:39.330
As you can see, I live in poverty.

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:43.280
But I must put in the effort to treat you to something delicious.

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:11.770
I am defeated.

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:15.020
Your ingenuity in serving your guests is unparalleled.

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:18.840
Perhaps that trap was part of your plans, too?

00:08:21.280 --> 00:08:25.100
First meetings are always awkward for anyone.

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:28.420
It's not easy to have a real conversation like that.

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:32.700
A real conversation is necessary for a tea ceremony.

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:39.150
The key point is to open the door to your heart.

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:45.470
Master Rikyū said he knew there was a trap, but that was such a lie.

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:08.040
Oh dear.

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:12.590
I'm completely caught up in his rhythm.

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:16.060
Everything he uses now seems so amazing and full of imperfection.

00:09:17.790 --> 00:09:21.940
Like this ancient tea pot. Look at those beautiful signs of use.

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:29.350
I'm sure it'll feel as great as feeling the shining bald head of a monk.

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:35.310
People say the new beats the old.

00:09:35.560 --> 00:09:39.450
But I know now that's not the case.

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:42.810
I...

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:45.740
I want my treasures like that, too!

00:09:53.810 --> 00:09:55.000
Master Hechikan.

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:57.610
I've opened the door to my heart.

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:02.540
I was restrained by my pride as a warrior.

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:06.900
I am here because I am looking for ideas regarding the mansion I am building.

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:13.170
How can I infuse the essence of imperfection?

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:16.870
How can I make my mansion the symbol of simplicity?

00:10:21.540 --> 00:10:23.300
How should I say this?

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:29.770
I was a top-class merchant in Kyoto.

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:32.840
I was obsessed in everything,

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:36.580
from the windows of my home to the moss in my yard.

00:10:37.790 --> 00:10:41.770
But it all got so tiring in the end.

00:10:43.430 --> 00:10:50.270
Perhaps I am using the tea ceremony to understand my guests as some sort of game.

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:53.010
Think about it.

00:10:53.270 --> 00:10:56.840
If I obsessed over every single object here...

00:10:56.420 --> 00:11:05.370
Note: This is basically a list of "luxury" items for a tea ceremony - 
from the tatami to the type of water.

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:11.220
I wouldn't enjoy this at all. It would just add to the stress.

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:14.400
And now I'm like this.

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:20.380
Master of the house

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:20.380
Guest

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:20.380
Teapot

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:25.610
I am completely happy with just these things.

00:11:29.760 --> 00:11:30.630
I see.

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:32.450
I can understand where he's coming from,

00:11:33.320 --> 00:11:35.470
but our opinions differ.

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:39.580
In my view, this place...

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:48.300
Bang! Wow! Gasp! Whoosh! Holy! Bling! Giggity! Smooth!

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:54.730
Only the darkness of this wall is displeasing.

00:11:56.740 --> 00:11:59.300
The key is to not get too caught up in things.

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:03.430
Things change. That is the law of this world.

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:09.220
Once you tighten up, you'll find it hard to move forward, like a snail.

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:10.440
How miserable.

00:12:11.650 --> 00:12:15.980
Just take it easy, regarding how you live and what you own.

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:28.300
Master Hechikan, you have served me wonderfully.

00:12:28.570 --> 00:12:31.690
I may have been the guest here,

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:34.170
but I have learned plenty.

00:12:35.970 --> 00:12:39.200
I'll take my leave now. I will give my thanks on a later meeting.

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:00.540
Much better now, right?

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:04.320
From the darkness comes light.

00:13:20.990 --> 00:13:24.330
That young man's quite good.

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:30.070
1586 - September - Izumi Province - Sakai

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:43.390
It was thanks to this moat that us businessmen can do our trading in peace.

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:46.310
Nobunaga's reign was so much better.

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:49.040
Looks like this is the end for Sakai.

00:13:54.570 --> 00:13:58.280
Sakai - Trade Association Meeting

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:04.440
The previous leader, Matsui Yukan, had a hands-off approach.

00:14:06.250 --> 00:14:11.310
From now on, I, Ishida Jibunosho, will take good care of all of you.

00:14:12.100 --> 00:14:16.520
No worries. The Chief Advisor will not sell out Sakai.

00:14:22.220 --> 00:14:24.710
You sound a bit overconfident.

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:29.650
Master Matsui will never speak to us with that tone.

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:34.120
Be careful with your words, Yamanoue Sōji.

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:39.190
You may find yourself out of favor from being Lord Hidenaga's tea master.

00:14:39.680 --> 00:14:42.970
The Chief Advisor has a master plan.

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:48.370
He wants to completely separate the warriors from the merchants.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:07.670
This is nice tea.

00:15:07.890 --> 00:15:13.350
You're right. It's perfect for a hot day like this.

00:15:13.690 --> 00:15:18.530
By counting the number of bubbles floating on top of the teapot, you can estimate the water temperature.

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:23.000
I wait until you are all used to the weather and then serve hot tea.

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:27.440
Your skills and your courtesy amaze us.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.940
It has been a great tea ceremony.

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:41.480
If I may interject, as the Head Master of tea here,

00:15:42.950 --> 00:15:48.280
Lord Ishida's way of the tea is intricate, but lacks amusement.

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:58.830
That's my master.

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:02.840
He whipped the Chief Advisor's little boy hard.

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:08.920
What do you mean by "amusement?"

00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:13.480
I am unable to learn with such illogical use of words.

00:16:13.590 --> 00:16:15.340
It is illogical.

00:16:15.970 --> 00:16:20.000
It is something attained through experience, something natural.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:22.860
To put it in other words,

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:31.030
the Chief Advisor himself is a man full of amusement.

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:48.390
That was a nice back-and-forth, Master Rikyū.

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:51.650
You brought out the Chief Advisor. 

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:54.730
Lord Ishida had no words to retort.

00:16:58.590 --> 00:17:01.270
We shall take our leave then.

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:13.580
What's the matter?

00:17:13.820 --> 00:17:16.140
You seem deep in thought.

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:21.730
I was wrong about you, Master.

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:28.450
You were the man behind the pure black tea bowl and the Taian tea room.

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:33.470
Why are you supporting the gilded tea room and the Jurakudai!?

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:38.980
You even said that the Chief Advisor, the exact opposite of simplicity, is amusing!?

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:45.640
Are you betraying the people and gravitating towards the warriors?

00:17:47.390 --> 00:17:50.530
In order to spread the beauty of imperfection,

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:53.350
the Chief Advisor is absolutely necessary.

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:59.700
My father had many famed items in our house in Satsuma.

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:03.330
We lost everything thanks to the warriors.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:05.320
Our family was ruined.

00:18:05.990 --> 00:18:11.260
Every famed item in this world came from the blood and sweat of the people of Sakai!

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:15.660
The warriors know not the worth of them!

00:18:15.850 --> 00:18:19.440
They perform the tea ceremonies as if they invented it themselves!

00:18:22.020 --> 00:18:24.810
You have created things beyond them!

00:18:24.860 --> 00:18:28.590
Wasn't it because you wanted to surpass the warriors with such beauty!?

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:20.160
Your voice is too loud, Sōji.

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:38.500
1586 - October - Kyoto, Jurakudai

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:51.150
The basic foundation of the mansion has already surpassed all others.

00:19:52.430 --> 00:19:54.740
The price for all this is astronomical.

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:57.700
We can't possibly afford to use such quality materials on everything.

00:19:58.650 --> 00:19:59.390
Out of my way!

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:03.020
What's going on?

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:05.970
Master Sōji is at the building site for Lord Hidenaga's residence!

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:14.690
What are you doing!?

00:20:14.970 --> 00:20:17.410
The Chief Advisor will kill you if he finds out about this!

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:22.920
As Lord Hidenaga's tea master, I do not like this tea room!

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:25.750
I must destroy it!

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:29.650
What happened, Master Sōji!?

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:33.760
I don't recall you being a man of violence!

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:51.170
Some petty warrior who is dabbling in the art of imperfection will never understand!

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:52.910
What did you say!?

00:20:57.100 --> 00:21:00.190
I've had it!

00:21:16.070 --> 00:21:23.210
I cannot live any longer with this evil stench hovering over me!

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:28.830
I heard you went to see Master Hechikan.

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:32.870
I'll walk the same path he did!

00:21:33.750 --> 00:21:38.270
I'm heading to the mountains and recording all the famed items I see!

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:45.050
I'll let the people of this world know what is good and what is evil.

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:53.460
What about your family?

00:21:53.900 --> 00:21:56.130
You have a wife and child, right?

00:22:00.990 --> 00:22:05.210
How can one chase after the essence of imperfection while worrying about familial matters?

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:23.180
What should we do, Lord Oribe?

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:25.880
If we leave things like this...

00:22:28.040 --> 00:22:30.430
I will explain to Lord Hidenaga.

00:22:32.430 --> 00:22:35.570
Do not let Sōji's family be wrapped up in this.

00:22:37.990 --> 00:22:38.560
Wait!

00:22:44.830 --> 00:22:47.620
Bring that log to my residence.

00:23:03.700 --> 00:23:06.430
Everytime I　

00:23:03.700 --> 00:23:06.430
Anata no mune

00:23:06.590 --> 00:23:08.820
feel your heart

00:23:06.590 --> 00:23:08.820
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.550 --> 00:23:14.910
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.550 --> 00:23:14.910
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:21.090
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:21.090
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:21.940 --> 00:23:27.250
Oppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:21.940 --> 00:23:27.250
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:33.340
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:33.340
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.340 --> 00:23:37.220
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.340 --> 00:23:37.220
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.450 --> 00:23:40.800
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.450 --> 00:23:40.800
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:46.670
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:46.670
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.770 --> 00:23:49.670
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.770 --> 00:23:49.670
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.750 --> 00:23:52.280
Without each other.

00:23:49.750 --> 00:23:52.280
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.370 --> 00:23:53.240
You should

00:23:52.370 --> 00:23:53.240
Soshite

00:23:53.330 --> 00:23:58.740
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.330 --> 00:23:58.740
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.850 --> 00:24:02.530
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.850 --> 00:24:02.530
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.590 --> 00:24:08.240
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.590 --> 00:24:08.240
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.320 --> 00:24:14.730
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.320 --> 00:24:14.730
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.790 --> 00:24:20.530
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.790 --> 00:24:20.530
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:22.010 --> 00:24:26.510
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:22.010 --> 00:24:26.510
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:35.410 --> 00:24:37.100
I'll be going first.

00:24:41.570 --> 00:24:43.540
I, Ieyasu, am still young.

00:24:49.010 --> 00:24:50.640
...That's right.

00:24:51.650 --> 00:24:52.720
First Love.

00:24:53.380 --> 00:24:57.910
To be a warrior or an aestete? That is the question.

00:24:56.680 --> 00:24:59.770
First Love
